TEXT
       Manometer reading  ____ mm of water
       Date:____________.From:_____________.To:______________

    1. Charge  5000  rubber  closures  in the bubbler kept under
       vertical  LAF unit protection. 
    2. Fill  up the bubbler with 0.45 micron membrane filtered  hot  distilled 
       water from bottom inlet.
    3. Start the filtered air supply to the bubbler and adjust the  qty.  such 
       that water overflows at a slow rate from the top drain while the  plugs 
       are  still  being agitated.  Continue this rinsing operation  till  the 
       rinse  water  is clear when checked in the inspectionhood.   (This  may 
       take about 10 minutes per load)
